1
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:41,100
Masters, just what is
my father suffering from?

2
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:45,380
The intrusion of chill into His
Majesty's body has caused blockages

3
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:48,380
Why aren't you treating him
since you know the reason?

4
00:01:48,380 --> 00:01:51,300
The two of them
hold different views

5
00:01:51,300 --> 00:01:55,100
Your Highness, we believe that
since His Majesty has a severe cold,

6
00:01:55,100 --> 00:01:57,500
we mustn't apply heat treatment

7
00:01:57,500 --> 00:01:59,300
Just who has the right treatment?

8
00:01:59,300 --> 00:02:01,500
I'm stating the facts

9
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:03,500
I'm treating the illness

10
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:07,500
His Majesty is ill yet you're here
engaging in wrangles!

11
00:02:09,260 --> 00:02:10,900
You came at the right time

12
00:02:10,900 --> 00:02:14,100
The three of them hold
three different views. I'm at a loss

13
00:02:15,260 --> 00:02:17,100
Your Highness, take it easy

14
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:20,500
Tell us your views
about His Majesty's condition

15
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:23,260
I think His Majesty's problem
is severe heat

16
00:02:23,260 --> 00:02:25,500
Master Zhang thinks
"tai yin" is the cause of it

17
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:27,900
Master Huang
has a different interpretation

18
00:02:27,900 --> 00:02:31,100
All the three prescriptions
are not the same

19
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:35,260
Wrong prescriptions may result
in dire consequences

20
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:39,100
Whether it's heat, yin, chill or wind,

21
00:02:39,100 --> 00:02:43,260
there is a kind of medicine
which will cure all illnesses

22
00:02:43,260 --> 00:02:46,100
Is it the glacial lotus flower
from the Western Region?

23
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:52,260
It's a rare plant not available
in the Palace's dispensary

24
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:55,260
It's as good as
not talking about it

25
00:02:57,500 --> 00:03:01,260
It can't be more coincidental.
There is one in my residence

26
00:03:01,260 --> 00:03:04,260
It was the Qie'erqi's envoy
who gave it to me

27
00:03:04,260 --> 00:03:07,500
You'll come home with me to get it

28
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:14,500
Your Highness!

29
00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:19,100
-How come you're in the Capital too?
-Because of Wei Delu

30
00:03:19,100 --> 00:03:23,220
-What is it this time round?
-He wanted to take his own life

31
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:25,220
How did it come to that?

32
00:03:25,220 --> 00:03:29,500
I guess he felt depressed
after failing the examination

33
00:03:31,100 --> 00:03:34,980
That's not possible. He might look
a little downcast when I saw him last,

34
00:03:34,980 --> 00:03:37,100
but it wasn't so bad
that he would contemplate suicide

35
00:03:37,100 --> 00:03:39,260
I even saw him gorging
10 buns at one go!

36
00:03:41,260 --> 00:03:45,500
Your Highness, did you say
anything which might have upset him?

37
00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:47,100
No, I didn't

38
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:50,100
Your Highness, you gave Master Wei
a gold-foil fan

39
00:03:50,100 --> 00:03:52,100
Could he have got the wrong idea?

40
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:57,500
It was meant for his travel expenses
but he thought I was fond of him

41
00:03:58,260 --> 00:04:00,100
I did explain to him

42
00:04:02,500 --> 00:04:05,500
Lu always thinks highly of himself
and he is very self-conscious

43
00:04:05,500 --> 00:04:09,500
The exam failure plus his unilateral
affection for Your Highness -

44
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:15,260
the double blow could have triggered
his attempt to take his own life

45
00:04:15,260 --> 00:04:17,100
Are you saying I'm guilty?

46
00:04:17,100 --> 00:04:20,100
Your Highness isn't to blame.
It was all a one-sided fantasy

47
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:25,220
He mistook Your Highness' goodwill for
fondness. He brought it upon himself

48
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:27,500
Hongying, no wild talk

49
00:04:28,260 --> 00:04:29,500
Is he doing fine?

50
00:04:30,100 --> 00:04:34,220
He's got over it.
But I have something to ask you

51
00:04:34,500 --> 00:04:37,500
With the kind of literary talent
Lu possesses, I'd expect him...

52
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:40,500
to become at least one of the top
three scholars if not the top

53
00:04:41,220 --> 00:04:42,500
I'd thought about that too

54
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:47,220
His falling short of his usual
standard could be due to nervousness

55
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:50,100
I have his essay with me

56
00:04:50,500 --> 00:04:54,100
Mei Shouquan asked him to do it again.
Please read it

57
00:04:56,500 --> 00:04:59,100
"Ping'an is an important town
in Luzhou County...

58
00:04:59,100 --> 00:05:01,220
"with no strange happenings
over the last century

59
00:05:01,220 --> 00:05:05,500
"It's a picture of prosperity with its
people living in peace and harmony..."

60
00:05:06,500 --> 00:05:12,500
It's an excellent essay but no
misdemeanour should be concluded from it

61
00:05:13,220 --> 00:05:15,500
Other candidates might have written
better essays

62
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:17,220
That could be the case

63
00:05:17,500 --> 00:05:21,100
Your Highness, shall I get
to the bottom of this matter?

64
00:05:21,100 --> 00:05:22,220
How?

65
00:06:48,100 --> 00:06:49,220
Huang Xinxin?

66
00:06:50,500 --> 00:06:55,500
Meat buns, bean-paste buns, lotus-paste
buns and basket buns are all my favourites

67
00:06:56,220 --> 00:06:59,500
To think this could've come
from Wang Xinxin's brush!

68
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:07,500
Here is Wei Delu's

69
00:07:09,500 --> 00:07:14,100
Isn't this the top candidate's essay?
So Wei Delu wrote it!

70
00:07:15,260 --> 00:07:17,500
Your Highness, I think
there is more than meets the eye

71
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:20,500
Your Highness must ask His Majesty
to give Wei Delu a chance,

72
00:07:20,500 --> 00:07:22,500
or it would be very unfair to him

73
00:07:23,100 --> 00:07:26,260
But my father is gravely ill.
I can't help solve this problem

74
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:29,100
His Majesty is gravely ill?

75
00:07:29,100 --> 00:07:32,260
He is bed-stricken.
He can't even attend court sessions

76
00:07:32,260 --> 00:07:34,500
The imperial physicians
can't do anything about it?

77
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:37,500
Three great imperial physicians?
They're mediocre physicians, rather!

78
00:07:37,500 --> 00:07:42,100
They can't even come up with
a common diagnosis. I'm so fed up!

79
00:07:42,500 --> 00:07:47,220
Why didn't you approach Mei Shouquan?
He may be able to help

80
00:07:47,900 --> 00:07:49,500
Why didn't I think of him?

81
00:08:11,500 --> 00:08:14,100
Sir, you need any help?

82
00:08:14,500 --> 00:08:17,500
You aren't good at planting trees.
Stand aside!

83
00:08:18,100 --> 00:08:20,500
It's no big deal.
I'll do it for you

84
00:08:22,900 --> 00:08:26,100
I don't need the hoe.
Please stand aside

85
00:08:27,500 --> 00:08:28,500
Watch me!

86
00:08:43,500 --> 00:08:45,500
Is it good? Good?

87
00:08:47,100 --> 00:08:49,500
Young man, you're very strong indeed

88
00:08:50,260 --> 00:08:55,500
Sis, I promised someone to plant trees
for him every day. It's become me

89
00:08:56,260 --> 00:08:58,100
It's good to plant trees

90
00:08:58,100 --> 00:09:02,500
Future generations will enjoy
the shade. It's a good job done

91
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:06,500
I didn't get to know it well
when I started off

92
00:09:06,500 --> 00:09:10,100
As I went along, I began
to enjoy the fun of it

93
00:09:10,100 --> 00:09:14,220
As it is, I feel so out of place
if I don't plant a few trees every day

94
00:09:15,500 --> 00:09:20,100
Sir, I guess you must have
reached 60 years of age

95
00:09:21,500 --> 00:09:26,500
-Sixty? Add another sixty!
-120?

96
00:09:27,220 --> 00:09:29,260
I'm not considered too old

97
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:33,220
What? Haven't all of you
become old demons?

98
00:09:36,500 --> 00:09:40,220
I mean this place
has become an elderly's kingdom

99
00:09:41,220 --> 00:09:45,220
It's not an elderly's kingdom;
it's a longevity village!

100
00:09:47,260 --> 00:09:48,900
This is unbelievable!

101
00:09:49,260 --> 00:09:55,500
We're blessed by the three stars.
They give us a long life!

102
00:09:59,900 --> 00:10:05,500
To tell you the truth,
we've begun to feel tired of living

103
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:07,700
Feeling tired?

104
00:10:10,260 --> 00:10:13,500
Oh yes, I nearly forgot
what I came here for

105
00:10:15,100 --> 00:10:17,100
Have you ever seen this lady?

106
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:27,100
-We seem to have seen her
-Where is she?

107
00:10:27,100 --> 00:10:29,100
-She is a petty thief
-A thief?

108
00:10:46,500 --> 00:10:49,500
-We seem to have seen her
-Where is she?

109
00:10:49,500 --> 00:10:52,100
-She is a petty thief
-A thief?

110
00:10:53,500 --> 00:10:54,500
Nonsense!

111
00:10:54,500 --> 00:10:57,500
-Where are you from?
-I came from Ping'an Town

112
00:10:57,500 --> 00:11:01,220
-I lost her on the way here
-So you two are one!

113
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:07,220
Hey, don't go away!

114
00:11:09,260 --> 00:11:12,260
Are you getting more muddled or what?

115
00:11:14,500 --> 00:11:17,100
-I know you...
-I don't know you!

116
00:11:17,100 --> 00:11:19,100
-I do know you...
-I don't...

117
00:11:22,500 --> 00:11:27,100
I thank Heaven for letting me
run into my lucky star

118
00:11:27,500 --> 00:11:30,500
O Lucky Star,
please accept a bow from me!

119
00:11:31,220 --> 00:11:34,220
Lucky Star?
Please get up...

120
00:11:35,260 --> 00:11:39,220
Granny, Save the kneeling.
I don't know you

121
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:44,500
My name is Wang Xiaoniu.
Don't you remember me?

122
00:11:45,500 --> 00:11:48,260
-100 years ago...
-100 years ago?

123
00:11:48,500 --> 00:11:51,220
-You blessed my family...
-Did I?

124
00:11:51,500 --> 00:11:54,500
You even took the monkey
from our house

125
00:11:55,260 --> 00:12:00,500
Wang Xiaoniu? 100 years ago?
The monkey from your house?

126
00:12:03,500 --> 00:12:08,100
Granny, the elderly in this village
seem to be talking through their hats!

127
00:12:08,900 --> 00:12:12,100
Master Fortune, I'm no crackpot

128
00:12:12,500 --> 00:12:15,500
You must've been too busy
to remember things

129
00:12:17,500 --> 00:12:22,500
I guess we might have offended your
brother, Prosperity, not long ago

130
00:12:22,500 --> 00:12:25,260
You must've taken umbrage, right?

131
00:12:27,220 --> 00:12:29,260
Oh, my god!

132
00:12:30,260 --> 00:12:33,220
How did I bump into
this school of muddled elderly!

133
00:12:36,500 --> 00:12:39,500
Forget it, I'm only a passer-by

134
00:12:39,500 --> 00:12:43,500
I'd like to ask you
if you've seen this lady before

135
00:12:48,500 --> 00:12:50,100
I know this girl

136
00:12:51,500 --> 00:12:53,500
-Where is she?
-She is a thief

137
00:12:57,500 --> 00:13:03,100
Master Fortune, that girl couldn't
have been more nasty than she was

138
00:13:03,100 --> 00:13:06,260
She came to our Three Star Temple
and stole the offerings

139
00:13:06,500 --> 00:13:11,500
She even wanted to steal
the gold nuggets from the three of you

140
00:13:13,500 --> 00:13:17,500
Our village had never seen
something so absurd

141
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:20,100
Everybody was so enraged

142
00:13:20,500 --> 00:13:27,220
We couldn't believe a pretty and
quiet girl like her could do that to us

143
00:13:27,220 --> 00:13:31,220
Granny, that could never happen.
It was a misunderstanding

144
00:13:31,500 --> 00:13:36,220
A misunderstanding? You will question
her later, won't you?

145
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:38,100
-Question her?
-Sure, I will

146
00:13:38,100 --> 00:13:42,100
I will get everybody here
to pay respect to our fortune star...

147
00:13:45,500 --> 00:13:47,500
Oh my, she is such a muddled soul!

148
00:13:53,500 --> 00:13:56,100
Shuangxi, so you're here!

149
00:13:59,500 --> 00:14:03,100
Is that you, Fuqi-ge?
I'm not dreaming, am I?

150
00:14:03,500 --> 00:14:06,260
You're still alive?
Didn't you fall off the cliff?

151
00:14:06,260 --> 00:14:09,220
You aren't dreaming.
I didn't die

152
00:14:09,220 --> 00:14:13,500
Please don't wake me up
if this is a dream!

153
00:14:14,100 --> 00:14:18,500
I begged the Trio to protect you.
Indeed they did

154
00:14:18,500 --> 00:14:21,500
The Trio didn't save my life.
Deity of Mountain did

155
00:14:41,500 --> 00:14:42,900
Where am I?

156
00:14:44,100 --> 00:14:46,100
Didn't I fall off a cliff?

157
00:14:50,100 --> 00:14:51,500
Indeed I'm not dead!

158
00:14:55,260 --> 00:14:57,100
Is this a dream of what?

159
00:15:00,500 --> 00:15:07,220
Wasn't my hand smashed to bits?
But it's perfect! This is magical!

160
00:15:10,100 --> 00:15:11,500
I saved your life

161
00:15:12,260 --> 00:15:16,220
You unblocked my nose when you
were falling. I saved your life!

162
00:15:16,220 --> 00:15:17,300
Now we're quits!

163
00:15:17,500 --> 00:15:20,500
Who unblocked your nose?
Just who are you?

164
00:15:22,900 --> 00:15:26,260
I'm Deity of Mountain
who takes care of all the mountains

165
00:15:27,100 --> 00:15:28,260
Deity of Mountain?

166
00:15:28,260 --> 00:15:34,100
That Longevity Star of yours let off
the foulest of air the other time

167
00:15:34,100 --> 00:15:36,100
I lost the sense of smell as a result

168
00:15:36,500 --> 00:15:41,260
You pulled my nostril hair by accident
while you were falling

169
00:15:42,100 --> 00:15:46,500
My nose was unblocked and I could
smell again. So I saved your life

170
00:15:47,220 --> 00:15:53,100
Wow, that's super-exaggeration!
When did I pull your nostril hair?

171
00:15:53,500 --> 00:15:58,100
Tell me if you're holding
my nostril hair or yours!

172
00:16:00,260 --> 00:16:04,220
You mean this is your nostril hair?
You can have it back

173
00:16:04,220 --> 00:16:06,220
I have nothing to reciprocate

174
00:16:08,100 --> 00:16:14,100
Say that again! I gave you
the magic power with a condition

175
00:16:15,260 --> 00:16:18,220
-What condition?
-You must plant trees!

176
00:16:19,500 --> 00:16:23,500
I did the layout for this forest.
Do you like it?

177
00:16:24,500 --> 00:16:28,500
Very nice, but it's rather desolate

178
00:16:29,100 --> 00:16:34,500
Worse still, it's like a lady's
bald pate. It's horrible

179
00:16:35,260 --> 00:16:40,100
You and I will turn it lush-green.
It'll look beautiful

180
00:16:40,500 --> 00:16:46,100
The three stars can let off
any amount of foul air

181
00:16:46,100 --> 00:16:49,100
These trees will purify the air!

182
00:16:50,100 --> 00:16:55,100
Your explanation can't be any clearer.
I understand every word of it!

183
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:58,260
I will appoint you to do the job

184
00:16:59,500 --> 00:17:02,220
Come on,
I can't possibly do it on my own

185
00:17:02,900 --> 00:17:06,500
Use your fist to punch a hole
in the soil and plant the seedling

186
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:12,220
-This hand of mine?
-Try doing it if you don't believe me

187
00:17:24,100 --> 00:17:28,500
That power can only be used
to plant trees and do good to mankind

188
00:17:28,500 --> 00:17:32,260
You'll get a mark and additional power
for every tree you plant

189
00:17:32,260 --> 00:17:35,260
You'll lose everything
if you start thinking crooked!

190
00:17:35,500 --> 00:17:38,100
I have a hand with limitless power

191
00:17:38,500 --> 00:17:41,100
Now tell me why you're kept in here

192
00:17:41,500 --> 00:17:43,100
I was so hungry...

193
00:17:45,900 --> 00:17:47,260
Three Star Temple?

194
00:17:50,100 --> 00:17:53,500
I don't know what's happened to Fuqi-ge.
Could he have been captured?

195
00:18:00,220 --> 00:18:04,100
Dear Deities, may you bless
Fuqi-ge with safety

196
00:18:06,500 --> 00:18:10,100
I'm willing to use my life
to exchange for his safety

197
00:18:10,500 --> 00:18:13,100
I beg you to protect Fuqi-ge

198
00:18:38,900 --> 00:18:42,500
Dear Deities, I'm starving
and I don't carry any money

199
00:18:42,500 --> 00:18:45,500
Will you let me have one - just one?

200
00:18:48,260 --> 00:18:49,260
Thank you!

201
00:18:59,100 --> 00:19:01,500
How dare you come to steal
from the temple!

202
00:19:01,500 --> 00:19:06,500
Granny, I didn't steal. I asked Deities
for permission to have just one pear

203
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:09,100
Men! Men...!

204
00:19:15,900 --> 00:19:19,100
I didn't steal.
I did ask the deities first...

205
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:24,500
Why did you come here to steal?

206
00:19:25,100 --> 00:19:27,260
She came to steal.
Lock her up!

207
00:19:28,100 --> 00:19:31,100
That was how I was brought here

208
00:19:31,500 --> 00:19:35,100
Those old men and women
had nothing better to do!

209
00:19:35,100 --> 00:19:38,500
Fuqi-ge, don't blame them.
It was my fault

210
00:19:39,220 --> 00:19:43,220
I stole a pear.
I was terribly hungry. I just had one

211
00:19:43,500 --> 00:19:46,100
Don't you blame them.
They are decent people

212
00:19:46,500 --> 00:19:50,100
I won't blame them.
Let's just get out of this place!

213
00:19:50,500 --> 00:19:53,500
Stay away. I'll break the door
with my right arm

214
00:20:03,500 --> 00:20:07,220
Fuqi-ge, didn't you say
you had limitless power?

215
00:20:08,100 --> 00:20:09,500
The deity didn't lie to me

216
00:20:09,500 --> 00:20:13,220
He said I could only use the power
to plant trees and not other things

217
00:20:15,500 --> 00:20:17,900
Trust him to be so selfish!

218
00:20:18,500 --> 00:20:21,220
Not to worry.
I'll bang the door open!

219
00:20:29,100 --> 00:20:30,220
Let's go!

220
00:20:59,980 --> 00:21:03,100
Don't you turn around
and accuse me of bullying!

221
00:21:03,500 --> 00:21:07,220
Trust you to be doing evils
in our village!

222
00:21:08,900 --> 00:21:14,220
Will you please wake up and let us off?
This is all a misunderstanding!

223
00:21:14,500 --> 00:21:16,100
Yes, a misunderstanding

224
00:21:16,100 --> 00:21:20,260
To think you could even ruin this door!
Is this a misunderstanding?

225
00:21:20,500 --> 00:21:24,500
All of us saw you were trying
to run off with that thief

226
00:21:24,500 --> 00:21:26,500
You consider that a misunderstanding?

227
00:21:26,500 --> 00:21:28,500
-I'm not a thief
-You are!

228
00:21:30,500 --> 00:21:33,500
I've been trying to stay calm
and plead with you

229
00:21:33,500 --> 00:21:36,100
Don't you try to test my limits!

230
00:21:37,100 --> 00:21:43,100
You saw how I could use
my fist to plant trees!

231
00:21:43,500 --> 00:21:45,500
-Don't you fear?
-We don't!

232
00:21:47,260 --> 00:21:52,100
Sorry, I made a blunder.
I ask you for forgiveness

233
00:21:52,500 --> 00:21:56,100
Lock me up if you have to.
Please let him off

234
00:21:56,500 --> 00:21:59,500
Tell him not to give us more trouble
and we'll let him off

235
00:21:59,980 --> 00:22:02,500
When are you ready to let her go?

236
00:22:02,900 --> 00:22:05,500
We'll let her go only after
the three stars' birthdays

237
00:22:05,500 --> 00:22:08,220
What's the reason?

238
00:22:08,500 --> 00:22:12,500
First, we must punish her; and second,
we want to calm the three stars' anger

239
00:22:12,500 --> 00:22:18,500
Warped theory. How can the icons
get angry when they're made of clay?

240
00:22:23,500 --> 00:22:28,100
I'm sorry. I will stay.
Let me go

241
00:22:29,220 --> 00:22:31,500
They're up in arms.
You'd better go

242
00:22:32,500 --> 00:22:34,100
Get going! Go...!

243
00:22:37,260 --> 00:22:39,220
Shuangxi! Shuangxi...!

244
00:22:54,500 --> 00:23:00,100
A bunch of muddled heads -
so old yet so childish!

245
00:23:01,900 --> 00:23:04,500
I'd have bashed you up
if you'd been younger!

246
00:23:06,260 --> 00:23:10,220
It's all your fault.
You created all this mess!

247
00:23:15,500 --> 00:23:19,220
Stop rumbling, will you?
You'll have nothing to eat!

248
00:23:27,260 --> 00:23:29,220
I refuse to touch your stuff!

249
00:23:30,100 --> 00:23:34,100
Shuangxi got into trouble
from eating your stuff!

250
00:23:36,220 --> 00:23:41,100
You three deities, all you do
is to laugh and have merriment

251
00:23:41,100 --> 00:23:43,900
Do you know
what human sufferings mean?!

252
00:23:44,500 --> 00:23:47,220
Praying to you
is the last thing I'd do!

253
00:23:47,220 --> 00:23:49,500
Fortune Star, where are you?

254
00:23:52,500 --> 00:23:56,500
Fortune Star!
Fortune Star, where are you?

255
00:23:59,500 --> 00:24:06,500
I, the village head, have told
the villagers you are the fortune star!

256
00:24:07,100 --> 00:24:08,260
She is the village head?

257
00:24:08,500 --> 00:24:12,100
They'll come and pay homage to you
very soon

258
00:24:12,100 --> 00:24:14,500
Fortune Star, where are you?

259
00:24:16,260 --> 00:24:18,100
Where are you hiding?

260
00:24:19,260 --> 00:24:23,100
Your Lordships, may you bless us
with a bumper harvest!

261
00:24:30,500 --> 00:24:32,220
Wang Xiaoniu!

262
00:24:34,500 --> 00:24:38,220
Who am I?
Can't you tell who I am?

263
00:24:38,500 --> 00:24:41,100
Aren't you the fortune star!

264
00:24:41,500 --> 00:24:46,220
I've been wanting to see you again
for more than a hundred years

265
00:24:46,220 --> 00:24:47,500
Are you sure?

266
00:24:52,500 --> 00:24:57,100
How come you look different?
Where is your beard?

267
00:24:57,100 --> 00:24:59,100
Er...

268
00:25:02,220 --> 00:25:08,220
Wang Xiaoniu, all the deities in the
Heavenly Court have shaved their beard

269
00:25:10,100 --> 00:25:14,500
The heavily bearded Zhong Kui
is completely clean-shaven

270
00:25:15,500 --> 00:25:18,100
My Lordship! Mr Lordship!

271
00:25:18,500 --> 00:25:22,500
A day in heaven
is a hundred days on earth

272
00:25:22,500 --> 00:25:27,100
You've turned old and muddle-headed.
You ought to be reprimanded

273
00:25:27,500 --> 00:25:30,500
What have I done that I should
invite such anger from you?

274
00:25:30,500 --> 00:25:33,100
You came to pay homage to me
but without any offerings!

275
00:25:33,100 --> 00:25:37,100
-I'm starving!
-Aren't there plenty of offerings?

276
00:25:38,260 --> 00:25:40,220
These offerings?
Those two...er...

277
00:25:41,500 --> 00:25:44,500
Longevity and Prosperity
have taken them all

278
00:25:45,500 --> 00:25:47,220
I beg your forgiveness!

279
00:25:48,100 --> 00:25:54,220
Wasn't there a Yu Shuangxi who came
to your village not long ago?

280
00:25:55,100 --> 00:25:59,100
-Who is Yu Shuangxi?
-That petty thief

281
00:26:00,500 --> 00:26:02,700
-I know
-You people have wronged her!

282
00:26:03,220 --> 00:26:06,260
She'd been taking care of the three
of us in Three Star Temple...

283
00:26:06,260 --> 00:26:07,500
ever since she was a girl

284
00:26:07,500 --> 00:26:09,900
She'd clean our faces
whenever they were dirty

285
00:26:09,900 --> 00:26:13,100
She did that for 20 years without fail

286
00:26:13,100 --> 00:26:17,500
Unfortunately, she came to your
Longevity Village to seek refuge

287
00:26:18,260 --> 00:26:22,100
She just took a bite of a pear -
a rotten pear at that

288
00:26:22,100 --> 00:26:26,500
She chose to eat it for fear that it
might give us, the deities, the runs

289
00:26:26,500 --> 00:26:30,100
-Really? Very noble of her
-Noble, right?

290
00:26:31,100 --> 00:26:36,220
Yet you accused her of theft.
Aren't all of you muddle-headed?

291
00:26:36,500 --> 00:26:40,100
Yes, we're muddled heads
and we deserved to be reprimanded

292
00:26:40,100 --> 00:26:43,220
-You'd better get her freed
-I'll ask the villagers to let her go

293
00:26:43,220 --> 00:26:47,100
-I'll ask them to pray to you
-Hold it. No need

294
00:26:47,100 --> 00:26:52,100
We deities like quietness.
We don't like to be disturbed

295
00:26:52,100 --> 00:26:55,500
It's your blessing that you get to see
me today. Others aren't as lucky

296
00:26:56,260 --> 00:26:57,500
You may go

297
00:26:57,500 --> 00:27:01,220
Why don't you eat all of these?
I have plenty of them!

298
00:27:12,100 --> 00:27:16,220
I've got you freed at last.
We've got rid of those old fogeys!

299
00:27:16,900 --> 00:27:19,260
I've done another good turn!

300
00:27:20,100 --> 00:27:22,500
-I've run out on my own!
-Give me the character "blessing"!

301
00:27:22,500 --> 00:27:26,220
Why should I?
You cheated the old lady

302
00:27:26,500 --> 00:27:28,500
Isn't saving you a good turn
I've done?

303
00:27:28,500 --> 00:27:31,500
How could I get you out
if I didn't cheat them?

304
00:27:31,500 --> 00:27:33,220
You like to talk rubbish!

305
00:27:34,100 --> 00:27:36,220
But I feel like having a dream

306
00:27:37,900 --> 00:27:43,220
Shuangxi, blame it on me. I've not
been able to bring happiness

307
00:27:43,500 --> 00:27:46,500
You've been through a lot
ever since you were with me

308
00:27:47,260 --> 00:27:51,500
Fuqi-ge, knowing you must be
the greatest blessing I've received

309
00:27:52,220 --> 00:27:53,500
You needn't console me

310
00:27:54,100 --> 00:27:57,220
You are the person who cares most
about me in this world

311
00:27:57,900 --> 00:28:01,220
Everybody else was afraid of me
when I contracted the disease

312
00:28:01,220 --> 00:28:04,500
You were the best to me. You even
barged into the quarantine camp

313
00:28:04,500 --> 00:28:08,100
I will forever remember
your compassion

314
00:28:08,100 --> 00:28:13,220
Didn't I tell you many times
that we'd share weal and woe?

315
00:28:14,260 --> 00:28:16,500
I don't have the means
to give you happiness now

316
00:28:17,100 --> 00:28:21,220
But I will never leave you alone
if you're faced with hardship

317
00:28:21,220 --> 00:28:24,260
I will die with you even if
it means death to me

318
00:28:26,260 --> 00:28:31,220
Fuqi-ge, will you promise
not to leave me again from now on?

319
00:28:32,500 --> 00:28:34,260
We'll stick together forever

320
00:29:16,220 --> 00:29:19,500
Father, are you feeling better
these few days?

321
00:29:20,260 --> 00:29:23,500
I'm getting on in age.
My days are numbered

322
00:29:23,500 --> 00:29:25,500
Father, please don't think that way

323
00:29:26,500 --> 00:29:32,220
Everybody says I will live a long, long
life. Nobody lives that long a life

324
00:29:33,220 --> 00:29:37,100
Won't I become a strange being
if I live to 10,000 years of age?

325
00:29:38,500 --> 00:29:44,500
I don't fear death.
You remain the only worry I have

326
00:29:45,100 --> 00:29:48,100
I shouldn't have made you worry.
I'm sorry

327
00:29:48,100 --> 00:29:50,500
I've not been fair to you

328
00:29:51,500 --> 00:29:57,100
The affairs of the kingdom
have made me neglect your marital plan

329
00:29:58,100 --> 00:30:03,500
If I were to die one day
and leave you alone in this world,

330
00:30:04,100 --> 00:30:08,100
I would hardly feel at ease

331
00:30:08,500 --> 00:30:11,100
Father, you will get well

332
00:30:13,220 --> 00:30:17,500
I believe Marquis Yonghuan
is a rare talent

333
00:30:19,260 --> 00:30:24,500
What do you think
if I make him my son-in-law?

334
00:30:25,260 --> 00:30:28,500
I'd like to keep Father company
for a longer period

335
00:30:29,500 --> 00:30:34,100
I take it as a yes answer
since you don't reject the idea

336
00:30:35,220 --> 00:30:38,100
Let's not talk so much.
Take the medicine first

337
00:30:40,220 --> 00:30:43,100
It's so bitter.
I don't feel like taking it

338
00:30:47,220 --> 00:30:49,500
I don't want any.
It's very bitter

339
00:30:50,100 --> 00:30:53,220
Father, good medicine is often bitter

340
00:30:54,100 --> 00:30:56,500
It's very bitter.
You may try some

341
00:31:03,500 --> 00:31:07,500
Now you know the misery
I've been through

342
00:31:09,260 --> 00:31:12,220
Father, I got to know of
an excellent physician among the folks

343
00:31:12,220 --> 00:31:14,100
I'll get him to treat you

344
00:31:14,100 --> 00:31:18,500
-The medicine he prescribes isn't bitter?
-I assure you it isn't

345
00:31:19,260 --> 00:31:20,700
-Are you sure?
-I am

346
00:31:20,700 --> 00:31:25,500
-Sure?
-Promise. It isn't bitter

347
00:31:25,500 --> 00:31:29,100
-In that case, send for him
-You must take the medicine

348
00:31:30,220 --> 00:31:34,100
Your Highness, we're told that
you're inviting a physician...

349
00:31:34,100 --> 00:31:36,100
from among the common folks
for His Majesty

350
00:31:36,500 --> 00:31:38,100
That's absolutely true

351
00:31:38,100 --> 00:31:40,500
You must never do that

352
00:31:41,100 --> 00:31:45,220
How can a quack physician be allowed
to get near to His Majesty?

353
00:31:46,100 --> 00:31:49,900
Indeed, Your Highness. People out
there will start ridiculing us...

354
00:31:49,900 --> 00:31:52,260
for not having the talents
in the palace

355
00:31:52,500 --> 00:31:54,500
You only bother about your pride

356
00:31:54,500 --> 00:31:56,500
You never do a good job
of treating my father

357
00:31:56,500 --> 00:32:00,500
Don't you feel embarrassed
now that Father is getting worse?

358
00:32:04,260 --> 00:32:07,220
Your Highness, these gentlemen
said that with good intentions

359
00:32:07,220 --> 00:32:09,500
You may simply grab a physician
out of desperation

360
00:32:10,100 --> 00:32:11,900
I've sought my father's opinion

361
00:32:11,900 --> 00:32:14,100
Still you mustn't get a person
like Mei Shouquan

362
00:32:14,100 --> 00:32:17,220
How can a person with such
a lousy name treat His Majesty?

363
00:32:17,500 --> 00:32:20,500
His Majesty must never let himself
be treated by such a person

364
00:32:20,500 --> 00:32:24,220
He has neither "quan"(wellness)
nor "shou"(longevity)!

365
00:32:25,500 --> 00:32:31,100
-Unless he changes his name
-Yes, change it to You Shouquan

366
00:32:31,500 --> 00:32:35,100
He's not allowed to treat His Majesty
if he refuses to change his name

367
00:32:35,100 --> 00:32:38,100
Absurd! Father judges a person
by his knowledge and talent

368
00:32:38,100 --> 00:32:40,500
He'd never evaluate a person
by his name alone

369
00:32:41,100 --> 00:32:47,100
Since there is a stalemate, I suggest
we accept Her Highness' decision

370
00:32:47,100 --> 00:32:48,260
We'll invite Master Mei to come

371
00:32:48,260 --> 00:32:51,100
But he must be grilled
by the three physicians first..

372
00:32:51,100 --> 00:32:53,500
before he's qualified
to treat His Majesty

373
00:32:55,500 --> 00:32:59,500
I will accept the decision
if he is a real talent

374
00:33:00,220 --> 00:33:04,220
But what if he is one of those
itinerant quack physician?

375
00:33:04,220 --> 00:33:07,220
Have him locked behind heavenly bars
awaiting His Majesty's punishment

376
00:33:07,220 --> 00:33:11,100
Yes, locked behind heavenly bars
and sentenced to death

377
00:33:11,100 --> 00:33:13,100
His family will be decimated too!

378
00:33:13,100 --> 00:33:15,500
Your Highness,
what is your opinion?

379
00:33:16,220 --> 00:33:19,100
I have confidence in Master Mei.
I believe he'll pass the test

380
00:33:34,900 --> 00:33:39,100
Master Mei, you claim
to be an excellent physician

381
00:33:39,100 --> 00:33:42,500
Would you like to start with treating
this palace maid?

382
00:33:42,500 --> 00:33:48,100
I wouldn't stake that claim
but I will try my best to treat her

383
00:33:48,100 --> 00:33:50,100
Don't you say we never remind you

384
00:33:50,500 --> 00:33:55,100
You'd be deceiving His Majesty
if you give a wrong diagnosis

385
00:33:55,100 --> 00:33:58,500
-Your family will be decimated
-I'm aware of that

386
00:33:59,100 --> 00:34:02,500
I got myself mentally prepared
before I came here

387
00:34:03,500 --> 00:34:06,500
You've been talking a great deal.
Can I start?

388
00:34:10,100 --> 00:34:12,500
Since that's the case, please proceed

389
00:34:16,500 --> 00:34:18,260
Please place your hand here

390
00:34:20,260 --> 00:34:21,260
Hold it!

391
00:34:21,500 --> 00:34:27,500
You're a commoner without any title.
You are not to touch a palace maid

392
00:34:28,500 --> 00:34:30,100
That's fine with me

393
00:34:30,100 --> 00:34:32,100
You may go to the back

394
00:34:35,500 --> 00:34:40,500
How will he treat the maid
if you don't allow him to touch her?

395
00:34:40,500 --> 00:34:44,100
Your Highness needn't worry.
I came prepared

396
00:34:46,500 --> 00:34:50,100
Please place the other end in her hand

397
00:34:54,500 --> 00:34:57,100
Fancy him reading her pulse
with a thread...

398
00:35:04,500 --> 00:35:08,100
Your Highness, she doesn't seem
to have any hidden illness

399
00:35:08,100 --> 00:35:10,500
Eat well, sleep well
and do more exercise

400
00:35:10,500 --> 00:35:13,220
She shouldn't have any problem
giving birth

401
00:35:13,500 --> 00:35:17,100
Audacity!
All palace maids aren't married

402
00:35:17,100 --> 00:35:20,220
Who is giving birth?
A load of crap!

403
00:35:20,220 --> 00:35:24,220
Not only is she pregnant,
she'll give birth to octuplets

404
00:35:30,100 --> 00:35:32,260
Are you sure that's your diagnosis?

405
00:35:32,260 --> 00:35:36,500
Your Highness, a human can't possibly
have octuplets, but dogs can

406
00:35:36,500 --> 00:35:40,500
Gentlemen, I think you're out
to pull a fast one on me!

407
00:35:41,220 --> 00:35:42,500
What octuplets?

408
00:35:51,500 --> 00:35:53,220
Your Highness, you saw that

409
00:35:53,220 --> 00:35:56,500
You're too much. How can you
play a prank on Master Mei?

410
00:35:57,220 --> 00:35:58,220
Enough!

411
00:35:59,500 --> 00:36:04,100
This is the end of the test.
We have confidence in your ability

412
00:36:04,100 --> 00:36:06,100
Please proceed to treat His Majesty

413
00:36:10,220 --> 00:36:15,100
Your Highness, you needn't go
with Master Mei. Please wait for us

414
00:36:29,500 --> 00:36:32,100
Halt! You're not
to go near to His Majesty!

415
00:36:33,220 --> 00:36:37,220
Your Lordship, how can I treat
His Majesty if I can't go near to him?

416
00:36:43,500 --> 00:36:47,100
A commoner like you is forbidden
to see His Majesty

417
00:36:48,260 --> 00:36:51,220
Your Lordship, I suppose I'm allowed
to read His Majesty's pulse...

418
00:36:51,220 --> 00:36:52,500
using a red thread, am I not?

419
00:36:52,900 --> 00:36:56,500
You aren't. His Majesty's pulse
is not for anybody to read

420
00:36:57,500 --> 00:37:00,500
I'm not allowed to go near
to His Majesty or read his pulse

421
00:37:00,500 --> 00:37:02,500
I suppose I can use
my sense of smell, can't I?

422
00:37:02,500 --> 00:37:06,500
Your Lordship, please allow me
to smell His Majesty's stools

423
00:37:06,500 --> 00:37:07,500
Sure!

424
00:37:08,260 --> 00:37:09,500
Get it ready

425
00:37:17,260 --> 00:37:18,500
Is this medicine for His Majesty?

426
00:37:20,100 --> 00:37:21,500
Take it away!

427
00:37:23,500 --> 00:37:25,100
Here are the stools

428
00:37:30,500 --> 00:37:34,220
Aren't you covering your nose?
Or I'll proceed!

429
00:37:44,100 --> 00:37:45,220
Done

430
00:37:47,900 --> 00:37:51,500
Master Mei, you've seen and smelt
His Majesty's stools

431
00:37:51,500 --> 00:37:54,100
Just what is His Majesty
suffering from?

432
00:37:55,220 --> 00:37:57,220
I can't tell you this minute

433
00:37:57,500 --> 00:38:01,500
Can I go home and mull over it
before giving my verdict?

434
00:38:02,500 --> 00:38:04,220
I thought he was so capable

435
00:38:04,500 --> 00:38:07,500
A useless physician, after all

436
00:38:07,500 --> 00:38:09,220
No more than what he is...

437
00:38:09,220 --> 00:38:11,220
-How much time do you need?
-A day

438
00:38:11,500 --> 00:38:13,220
Sure, a day

439
00:38:13,500 --> 00:38:20,100
Master Mei, mind that head of yours
if you can't come up with any diagnosis!

440
00:38:20,500 --> 00:38:22,500
Sure, I'm making a move

441
00:38:24,500 --> 00:38:27,220
Master Mei, you seemed to have
something you dared not say...

442
00:38:27,220 --> 00:38:29,900
after you examined the stools

443
00:38:30,500 --> 00:38:34,500
To tell you frankly,
they were not His Majesty's stools

444
00:38:34,500 --> 00:38:38,260
They belonged to that bitch
with the octuplets

445
00:38:39,100 --> 00:38:43,220
Are you saying someone swapped
the stools? Why should he do that?

446
00:38:43,500 --> 00:38:47,220
Someone must've meddled with
the medicine His Majesty took

447
00:38:47,220 --> 00:38:51,500
He didn't want me to find out.
So he swapped the stools

448
00:38:53,260 --> 00:38:55,220
Were the imperial physicians
behind all this?

449
00:38:55,220 --> 00:38:59,100
I don't think they have the guts
to do so. They must've been manipulated

450
00:39:00,260 --> 00:39:02,220
Why didn't you expose them?

451
00:39:02,220 --> 00:39:07,220
I didn't want to alert them.
Hence I asked for another day

452
00:39:08,500 --> 00:39:12,100
Audacious! Who could've been so rash
as to do this to His Majesty?!

453
00:39:12,100 --> 00:39:15,100
Your Highness, please remain composed

454
00:39:15,100 --> 00:39:18,260
I've asked Hongying
to do something very important

455
00:39:19,900 --> 00:39:23,100
Master Mei, here it is

456
00:39:25,260 --> 00:39:27,500
-What is this?
-His Majesty's stools

457
00:39:28,260 --> 00:39:32,100
Your Highness, indeed someone's treated
His Majesty with inert poison

458
00:39:32,500 --> 00:39:35,500
Who could've been so devious
as to do that to my father?!

459
00:39:35,500 --> 00:39:39,220
Your Highness, fret not.
The poison hasn't gone deep

460
00:39:39,220 --> 00:39:42,500
His Majesty should be fine after my
prescription purges him of the poison

461
00:39:43,500 --> 00:39:46,100
Hongying, take me
to the Palace's dispensary

462
00:39:46,500 --> 00:39:50,100
Your Highness, don't you worry.
His Majesty will be fine

463
00:39:56,500 --> 00:39:57,900
Anything else?

464
00:39:58,100 --> 00:40:01,500
He'd like to have the medicine
we prescribed for His Majesty

465
00:40:01,500 --> 00:40:04,980
But I asked him to leave

466
00:40:10,100 --> 00:40:13,100
This guy, Master Mei, isn't someone
to be trifled with

467
00:40:13,500 --> 00:40:16,220
It didn't take long for him
to cast doubts on some of you

468
00:40:16,500 --> 00:40:20,500
Your Lordship, we did it
according to your instructions

469
00:40:21,220 --> 00:40:24,100
Your Lordship, we depend on you
to save our lives

470
00:40:24,100 --> 00:40:25,500
Don't get paranoid

471
00:40:26,500 --> 00:40:30,100
He wouldn't do anything
without any hard evidence

472
00:40:31,500 --> 00:40:35,500
Destroy all the prescriptions and
tell Master Huang and Master Zhang...

473
00:40:35,500 --> 00:40:38,100
to seal their lips, get it?

474
00:40:39,100 --> 00:40:41,100
I know what to do, sir

475
00:40:41,100 --> 00:40:46,500
Your Lordship, if Mei Shouquan
is allowed to do what he wants,

476
00:40:46,500 --> 00:40:49,100
it's only a matter of time
before something happens

477
00:40:49,100 --> 00:40:53,100
I know what to do with Mei Shouquan.
You needn't worry

478
00:40:54,100 --> 00:40:58,100
Your Lordship, I can't
even sleep and eat well

479
00:40:58,500 --> 00:41:03,100
The punishment for trying to harm His
Majesty is death to all family members

480
00:41:04,500 --> 00:41:06,220
What is that supposed to mean?

481
00:41:07,500 --> 00:41:11,100
You're afraid of offending His Majesty
but not me?

482
00:41:11,100 --> 00:41:13,100
I wouldn't dare, Your Lordship...

483
00:41:18,500 --> 00:41:20,500
Please rise, Master Luo

484
00:41:23,500 --> 00:41:29,220
Fear not. His Majesty has agreed
to betroth the Princess to me

485
00:41:30,100 --> 00:41:34,100
Since His Majesty doesn't have a son,
I will rule the kingdom

486
00:41:35,100 --> 00:41:38,500
Be loyal to me
and I won't treat you badly

487
00:41:40,500 --> 00:41:42,100
Thank you, Your Lordship

488
00:41:42,100 --> 00:41:47,100
I will give my all
till the day I die

489
00:41:48,900 --> 00:41:52,500
-You may go
-I will take my leave

490
00:41:59,220 --> 00:42:00,220
Men!

491
00:42:12,980 --> 00:42:14,500
Hongying, where is it?

492
00:42:15,220 --> 00:42:18,260
-I will go straight on
-You'll go downhill

493
00:42:54,900 --> 00:42:57,100
Uncle, you have a weak heart...

494
00:42:58,500 --> 00:43:02,500
Your nails are so thin and soft -
an obvious sign of liver failing

495
00:43:02,500 --> 00:43:04,100
-Really?
-I bet

496
00:43:14,100 --> 00:43:20,100
Sir, your foul air is truly foul!
Your kidney is deficient too

497
00:43:20,500 --> 00:43:23,500
Do you see blood in your urine
in the morning?

498
00:43:24,260 --> 00:43:25,500
That's kidney ulcer...

499
00:43:41,500 --> 00:43:46,220
Uncle, that's very rude of you.
You really have bad breath

500
00:43:49,100 --> 00:43:53,100
You'd better know that your heart, liver,
lungs and kidneys are all defective

501
00:43:53,100 --> 00:43:54,900
You'd better stay away from women

502
00:43:54,900 --> 00:43:57,900
You'll dig your own grave
in two years if you don't!

503
00:44:01,100 --> 00:44:04,500
Uncle, there is nothing
you can do with my herbs!

504
00:44:05,500 --> 00:44:08,500
You must add sha shen,
dan shen and di huang -

505
00:44:08,500 --> 00:44:11,220
brew it with 8 bowls of water
until it becomes one

506
00:44:11,220 --> 00:44:14,220
Take it for 49 days
before your illness can be cured!

507
00:44:14,500 --> 00:44:18,220
I forgot to tell you the proportions.
Hey, come back!

508
00:44:18,500 --> 00:44:20,500
Master Mei, are you all right?

509
00:44:21,100 --> 00:44:22,260
I'm fine

510
00:44:22,900 --> 00:44:25,900
Who is that old man?
Why did he snatch your herbs?

511
00:44:25,900 --> 00:44:32,100
I read his pulse. He is a young man
who knows martial arts too

512
00:44:32,500 --> 00:44:35,500
Are you saying
he came to confront you?

513
00:44:36,220 --> 00:44:40,100
Other than Her Highness and you, only
Ouyang Xiaotian knew I was coming here

514
00:44:40,100 --> 00:44:42,100
He is behind all this?

515
00:44:42,100 --> 00:44:45,500
-Master Mei, what about the herbs?
-No big deal

516
00:44:45,500 --> 00:44:48,100
This hill is full of herbs and plants.
We'll start all over

517
00:44:51,220 --> 00:44:53,900
Shut up! Get lost!

518
00:44:56,500 --> 00:44:59,260
Just you watch out, Mei Shouquan!


